Changes from that work include:
- Huidu HD-WF2 (ESP32-S3) build target and HUB75 pin map
- A new two-column approach card, rendered off-screen and pushed to the
  panel as changed pixels only
- Heathrow runway, ETA and landing-phase model; landing traffic prioritised
- Aircraft sprites by ICAO type, fly-across transition following real
  heading and vertical rate, landing animation and scanning screen
- Display moved to its own task; watchdog and hang diagnostics
- Reworked web interface, live panel mirror and status endpoint
- Airline logos removed from the repository (bring your own)
